{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>After the end of a hundred and fifty days.</b> They began to diminish, and that was the first of Sivan. How? On the twenty-seventh of Kislev the rains ceased — that is three of Kislev and twenty-nine of Tevet, that is thirty-two, and Shevat and Adar and Nisan and Iyar are one hundred and eight — that is one hundred fifty."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:53.991200018Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}